      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know you aren't a doctor but is it really that serious? i've had migraines for years and they always feel like this. sometimes i get lightheaded or tingly too. it feels more like my usual pattern than a stroke. i don't really want to go to the er if it's just another migraine... it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. can't i just take some extra ibuprofen and wait it out here?",
