      "content": "but i'm literally just sitting on my couch right now and the pain is passing a little bit, it's not like i'm having a heart attack or anything. it just feels like a massive migraine episode. if i just take a bunch of high dose ibuprofen and maybe some of my old prescription migraine meds, wouldn't that be enough to just ride it out until tomorrow? i really just want to sleep this off, it's frustrating that you're being so alarmist about it.",
